[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="EnemyDef" load_steps=2 format=3]

; What nests on the key. Two slinks are the whole of level 2, and neither can kill a careless
; player: 4 damage a hit, at most four hits across both fights, against 20 health. That is
; deliberate - the hollow is where you learn the timing, and a tutorial that can kill you is
; a tutorial people reload rather than read.

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/data/enemy_def.gd" id="1_enemy"]

